OL,3,GNEWSAWhy no-one will pay for mangled
OL,4,Asculpture's repair bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo months ago, a major piece of public
OL,7,Fart was badly damaged in a car crash.
OL,9,FThe Armillary Sphere sculpture still
OL,10,Fstands in the centre of the roundabout
OL,11,Fat the junction of Banbury Road and
OL,12,FTrinity Way in Stratford-upon-Avon, but
OL,13,Fits steel is bent and twisted.
OL,15,FIt is in need of fixing. Or, its
OL,16,Fcritics say, in need of taking away.
OL,18,FThe thing is, it is unclear which - if
OL,19,Fany - of those options will happen.
OL,20,FNo-one will take responsibility for the
OL,21,Ffuture bill as mystery surrounds who is
OL,22,Fin charge of the artwork's upkeep.
